    description: Some("Barred from Earth\'s Olympics, the aliens run their own — and Traxsis sends its reigning champion Ooie Gooie to the 2044 games. Fifteen events riff on track and field, from sprints and pole vault to archery; the triple jump has you tap A and B to build speed, then press before the line to set your angle."),
